        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "The 4-Step Workflow",
          "desc": "Setiap rule melalui alur kerja berurutan: (1) Configure Parameters — atur nama, grup, prioritas, risk score, active period, dan cycle indicator. (2) Build Flow — bangun logika deteksi pada canvas visual. (3) Use Condition — definisikan kondisi penggunaan (khusus CONDITION). (4) Review & Submit — tinjau konfigurasi dan submit.",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff7ed,#fff);border-bottom:1px solid #fed7aa;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f97316\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"/></svg><div><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Rule Workflow</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">4 langkah berurutan — GENERAL &amp; CONDITION</div></div></div></div><div style=\"padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;\"><div style=\"padding:9px 0 9px 22px;border-left:2px solid #f97316;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-7px;top:11px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#f97316;border:2px solid #fed7aa;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(249,115,22,0.12);\"></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">1. Configure Parameters</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#475569;margin-top:2px;line-height:1.5;\">Nama, grup, prioritas, <strong style=\"color:#0f172a;\">risk score</strong>, <strong style=\"color:#0f172a;\">active period</strong>, &amp; <strong style=\"color:#0f172a;\">cycle indicator</strong></div></div><div style=\"padding:9px 0 9px 22px;border-left:2px solid #dbdade;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-7px;top:11px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #dbdade;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#6b7280;\">2. Build Flow</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2px;\">Bangun logika deteksi di canvas visual ReactFlow</div></div><div style=\"padding:9px 0 9px 22px;border-left:2px solid #dbdade;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-7px;top:11px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #dbdade;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#6b7280;\">3. Use Condition</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2px;\">Definisikan kondisi penggunaan — <strong style=\"color:#6b7280;\">khusus CONDITION</strong></div></div><div style=\"padding:9px 0 9px 22px;border-left:2px solid #dbdade;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;left:-7px;top:11px;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #dbdade;\"></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#6b7280;\">4. Review &amp; Submit</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2px;\">Tinjau konfigurasi dan submit rule</div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f97316\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#c2410c;\">Setiap rule melewati keempat tahap secara berurutan</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Understanding Canvas Area",
          "desc": "Canvas adalah area ReactFlow utama di tengah layout. Panel kiri berisi 6 tipe kondisi yang bisa di-drag. Toolbar bawah floating berisi info rule, Add Condition, Auto-arrange, Back, dan Continue. Navigasi dengan Space+Drag untuk pan, Scroll untuk zoom, dan drag node untuk memindahkannya.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
